t category, row 29"},{"sheet":"E09 Card Policy","cell":"D9","value":"The card is for HANGS business only. A personal charge is coded to 1910 Due From Employees and repaid by the cardholder within 30 days, by check or, with written consent, by payroll deduction.","formula":null,"unit":"text","source":"06 Policy/HANGS Company Card and Expense Policy v2.0.docx","sha256":"ace874132dfe95c74a218af2a1c65499c0351d7826df31ea0cea2545baf06903","locator":"Clauses CARD-1 to CARD-9; Appendix A, the coding guide by merchant category, row 9"}]},{"id":"f-receipt-7314","label":"Missing Receipt Over the Limit","sheet":"Charges","cell":"D14","value":418.76,"chain":[{"sheet":"Charges","cell":"D14","value":418.76,"formula":null,"unit":"USD"},{"sheet":"E07 Card Statement","cell":"H11","value":418.76,"formula":null,"unit":"USD","source":"01 Statement/Cobalt Harbor Card Statement - October 2026.pdf","sha256":"6ef4722b635549d9db28df685310b005227c9ee5cb7734c278c366624a6bc404","locator":"Pages 1 and 2, read line by line from the PDF text, row 11"},{"sheet":"E07 Card Statement","cell":"F11","value":"Lakeshore Lodge","formula":null,"unit":"text","source":"01 Statement/Cobalt Harbor Card Statement - October 2026.pdf","sha256":"6ef4722b635549d9db28df685310b005227c9ee5cb7734c278c366624a6bc404","locator":"Pages 1 and 2, read line by line from the PDF text, row 11"},{"sheet":"STM Page 1","cell":"A35","value":"10/15 10/16 7314 Lakeshore Lodge Spokane WA 418.76","formula":null,"unit":"text","source":"01 Statement/Cobalt Harbor Card Statement - October 2026.pdf","sha256":"6ef4722b635549d9db28df685310b005227c9ee5cb7734c278c366624a6bc404","locator":"Page 1, row 35"},{"sheet":"E01 Expense Card Lines","cell":"G11","value":"Supplier yard visit, 2 nights","formula":null,"unit":"text","source":"02 Expense Reports/Expense Report Export - October 2026.xlsx","sha256":"de29555acd8200b97e3d32665056ceae6db2f6c6a4f35a5bf7d744d2aaa6f41d","locator":"Card Lines!G11"},{"sheet":"E01 Expense Card Lines","cell":"J11","value